        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Class Description:  Bare Bait Dance's new class series is designed for the adult mover who wants to dive into contemporary modern technique in a supportive and playful atmosphere. Whether a novice mover or a dancer wanting to brush up on skills or learn a new style, all are welcome!"
      }
