      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Fubuki Daiko on their US tour, presented by Westside Theater. Fubuki Daiko reinvents traditional Japanese drumming with their eclectic and energetic performances that are part martial arts athleticism, part meditation, and all rhythm."
      }
