        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A reading of the latest one woman show by Moira Keefe, \"LIFE ON THE LUNCH LINE\" —a comedy about the hypocrisy of composting, food waste and recycling in schools across the country through the eyes ears and nose of a noon time elementary school assistant.  Written and Read by Moira Keefe, D"
